# CS4440 Project 1: Realizing Concurrency using Unix processes and threads

## Project Overview
This project implements file compression using run-length encoding with Unix processes and threads. The compression algorithm replaces sequences of 16+ identical bits with +count+ for 1s and -count- for 0s.

