## Compilation Instructions
To compile all programs, navigate to the project root directory and run:
```bash
make all
```

This will compile all 9 tasks using the provided Makefile with the following flags:
- `-std=c11 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -pedantic` for C compilation
- `-lpthread` for Task 9 (threading)

